spice
* List of Components
* M1, M2 - NMOS Transistors
* M3, M4 - PMOS Transistors
* ISS - Current Source
* SPICE Netlist
M1 5 1 6 6 NMOS
M2 5 2 6 6 NMOS
? Missing component
M4 2 3 4 4 PMOS
I1 4 6 ISS
* Voltage Definitions
V1 2 0 VDD
* Node Assignments
* 1 - Gate of M1
* 2 - Vout / Gate of M2 / Drain of M4
* 3 - Source of M3 / Drain of M4
* 4 - VDD / Source of M3 and M4
* 5 - Drain of M1 and M2
* 6 - Ground
